From 6eaac9161b021b554676e0ccf8e5e660dee67b09 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Creitin Gameplays <clton999@outlook.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 14:31:14 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/7] gitignore: ignore local build outputs and boot-experiment
 artefacts

Image.*, System.map.*, overlay .dtbo, *.symversions, localversion, the reconstructed configs and the device phone.config are build output or live copies; the source of truth for the latter is diag/configs/phone.config.
---
 .gitignore | 15 +++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 15 insertions(+)

diff --git a/.gitignore b/.gitignore
index be92dfa89957..5cda3c7fbb23 100644
--- a/.gitignore
+++ b/.gitignore
@@ -125,3 +125,18 @@ all.config
 
 # fetched Android config fragments
 kernel/configs/android-*.cfg
+
+#
+# Local build outputs and boot-experiment artefacts (Moto E32 / hawaii tree).
+# The source of truth for the diag patches is the PC repository
+# patches/kernel-sprd/; see diag/README.md in this tree.
+#
+/Image*
+/System.map*
+/localversion*
+*.dtbo
+*.symversions
+/scripts/module-lto.lds
+/phone.config
+/reconstructed_release.config
+/reconstructed_release_diff_config
-- 
2.47.3

